# Kept out of default rg/fd searches (both read .ignore; git, cargo, Docker and dagger do not).
# Generated, vendored or golden data: a match prints whole lines (regions.json is one 553 KB line).
# Search them on purpose with `rg -u` / `fd -u`.
/build/src/data/regions.json
/build/Cargo.lock
/build/assets/leaflet.js
/build/assets/leaflet.css
/build/assets/icons.svg
/build/tests/fixtures/
/build/tests/snapshots/
/e2e/package-lock.json
/e2e/functional/wheel-touch.json
